        -:  230:    /**
        -:  231:     * Provide an iterable view of the file collection.
        -:  232:     *
        -:  233:     * The map stores files via shared_ptr so that the copy constructor (used by Clone()) can
        -:  234:     * share ownership of payloads, keeping transient snapshots cheap.  Copy assignment, in
        -:  235:     * contrast, performs a deep copy so callers that mutate file fields through raw pointers
        -:  236:     * after assignment cannot affect the source.  Callers that need a guaranteed-unique mutable
        -:  237:     * copy from a const-ref source must allocate a new EMBEDDED_FILE explicitly.
